# docs/adr/
#
# Architecture Decision Records (ADRs)
#
# Responsibility:
#   This directory holds lightweight records of significant architectural
#   decisions made during the project. Each ADR captures the context,
#   decision, and consequences using the standard ADR template.
#
# Naming convention:
#   0001-<short-title>.md
#   0002-<short-title>.md
#   ...
#
# Reference: https://adr.github.io/
